    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You carry the gift of spellfire, a rare magic that channels the raw power of the Weave. Wielding spellfire takes a heavy toll on the body, so you have trained both mind and body to command this sacred power efficiently.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.xCBlCHh7lOh8taWq]{Spellfire Spark}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and Perception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagArcaneFocus]{Arcane Focus} (@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbafcCrystal000]{Crystal} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbafcWand000000]{Wand}), 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 36 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
